-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
<RSA PUBLIC KEY IN PEM FORMAT>
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----

This file documents the expected format of `mac_address_pub_key`.

The real key is NOT stored in this repository.
Jenkins injects it at build time before PyInstaller bundles it into the .exe.

For local development/tests: copy the key (staging or production)
and place it as `mac_address_pub_key` in the project root.
It is listed in .gitignore — will not be committed.

NOTE: staging and production use DIFFERENT keys.
Using a staging config with a production .exe (or vice versa) causes
silent authorization failure in device.py with no clear error in logs.
